Luca Pasqualino ( Rivals , The Musketeers ) and Louisa Harland ( Renegade Nell , Derry Girls ) also star the series, which comes from Dynamic Television and Clapperboard Studios , and is based on Jonas Geirnaert and Julie Mahieu's Belgian series De Dag . Ben Harris and Jesse O'Mahoney wrote the British version.

Mike Benson and Andy Morgan are the exec producers for Clapperboard, alongside Daniel March from Dynamic Television, and Tamryn Reinecke. Jake Rollins isp roducer, and Andy Tohill ( The Dig , Dalgliesh ) and Ryan Tohill ( The Dig , Dalgliesh ) co-directed.

EXCLUSIVE: Dublin-based post group SSVFX , which has worked on Sh&#x14D;gun and Game of Thrones , has appointed Jennifer Thompson as Head of Studio.

Thompson is returning to the Screen Scene Group-owned company, having previously worked there a management consultant and exec producer.

She has worked at European VFX studios such as Trixter in Germany, where she was Head of Production, and MPC Film in the UK. She has credits for the likes of The Lion King , Loki and The Suicide Squad . She now joins the 16-year-old SSVFX, which is known for creating complex visual effects. Related Stories News Playhouse Post Opens Doors On Soho Facility After Halo Assets Deal Executives Former Tubi Production Exec Ashla Soter Joins Post House Digital Sword

